## Purpose of Directory/File

/etc/kubernetes/   ----- Kubernetes configuration
/etc/kubernetes/manifests/ ----- 	Static Pod manifests
/etc/kubernetes/pki/ ------ Certificates and keys
/etc/kubernetes/admin.conf ---- Administrator kubeconfig
/var/lib/kubelet/	---- Kubelet state and configuration
/etc/containerd/	----- Containerd configuration
/etc/cni/net.d/	----- CNI configuration
/opt/cni/bin/	--- CNI plugin binaries
/var/lib/etcd/	---- Local etcd data
/var/log/	---- System logs
